          "claim": "Apply [F2] to this comparator and substitute its bound for $L^\\ne_{\\rm un}(f)$ in [F1]. The result is $L_{\\rm sup}(\\widehat f)\\le L^\\mu_{\\rm sup}(\\widehat f)\\le\\gamma L^\\mu_{\\gamma,\\rm sup}(f)+\\epsilon+\\frac{\\sqrt2L_0\\tau s(f)+2\\Gamma_M(S,\\delta)}{1-\\tau}$. The event from [F1] has probability at least $1-\\delta$, proving the corollary.",
          "inputs": [
            "F1",
